+``build_include()``
+^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
+
+Include additional files from the Bento build context in the image. It accepts one or more paths relative to the Bento context root, appends them to the build include list, and returns ``self`` so you can chain it with other configuration methods. The included files are copied into the image under ``./src/<name>``.
